  "body": "Workers shouldn't have access to `Document` objects, and WPT even tests for this in workers/semantics/xhr/001.html, however the spec doesn't seem to say anything about `response` (where `responseType==\"document\"`) and `responseXML` when being evaluated from a worker context.\n\nPerhaps we should be early-returning null in both cases?\n",
